          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "C. Assertion: Tendons connect bone to bone and allow joint movement. Reason: Tendons are made of tough connective tissue that transmits force from muscle to bone."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.144,
            0.774,
            0.178
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "D. Assertion: In a hinge joint, movement occurs primarily in one plane."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.179,
            0.772,
            0.198
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Reason: The bone ends are shaped to allow sliding in all directions."
